Installation instructions for Chadwick have moved to the documentation,
hosted at https://chadwick.readthedocs.io/en/latest/installation.html

In short:

Windows users should download the pre-built binaries attached to the
release on GitHub (https://github.com/chadwickbureau/chadwick/releases).

macOS/Linux users building from a release tarball can use the standard
autotools sequence:

    ./configure
    make
    make install

Building from a git checkout additionally requires running
`autoreconf -fi` first, since the generated `configure` script is not
committed to the repository.  See the documentation link above for
full details.
